{%- comment -%}
  Editorial gallery — a grid of photo shoots, styled to match the events
  pages (section-events.css / events.js) without the video/countdown
  machinery those sections carry.

  This section is intentionally STATIC rather than block-driven: the client
  has 14 shoots / 300+ photos, far past what Shopify's per-block settings
  can sanely hold (this originally used 8, then 35, image_picker fields per
  block before that became unworkable). The shoot list below is generated
  from the "final out (web)/" folder in the theme directory and points
  directly at Shopify CDN file URLs — the photos are uploaded to Settings →
  Files by hand (no app/API access is available for this project), using
  the exact filenames Shopify produces from the originals (spaces become
  underscores; everything else is left as-is).

  To add or change a shoot: edit `gallery_shoots_data` below. Each shoot is
  "Name::file1.jpg,file2.jpg,...", shoots separated by ";;". The first file
  listed is used as the grid thumbnail. If a photo 404s on the live site,
  it almost always means the uploaded file's name doesn't exactly match
  what's listed here (Shopify appends "_1" etc. to duplicate filenames) —
  check Settings → Files for the actual name Shopify gave it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'section-events.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'events.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings

  case s.tile_ratio
    when 'portrait'
      assign ratio = '3 / 4'
    when 'tall'
      assign ratio = '2 / 3'
    when 'square'
      assign ratio = '1 / 1'
    when 'landscape'
      assign ratio = '4 / 3'
    else
      assign ratio = '3 / 4'
